API.md §4.1 (Check), EVALUATION.md §8.1: a hard error a named record check raises in stage C of
`canon check` (E4002) names that check; the run is aborted, no E5001.
-- check-only --
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// A row of samples.
record Row {
  /// The samples.
  xs: [Int]

  check sixth: xs[5] > 0 else "the sixth sample is not positive"
}

/// A short row.
let row: Row = { xs: [1] }
-- findings.txt --
error[E4002]  a/a.canon:9:16
  row: index 5 out of range for length 1

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
